<title>POLAND: REMAK TURNS TO PROFIT IN JULY.</title>
<headline>REMAK TURNS TO PROFIT IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.40 vs   0.07 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.58 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.54 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Sales		    8.30 vs   4.76</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.36 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.98 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.64 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Sales		   43.94 vs  42.26</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish engineering firm is Remak SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
